<title>USA: Westar Capital raises stake in ADT Ltd.</title>
<headline>Westar Capital raises stake in ADT Ltd.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westar Captial Inc said Monday it raised its stake in ADT Ltd to 33,971,296 common shares or 24.1 percent of the outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Westar said its latest transactions include the purchase of 1.3 million common shares on September 30 at prices ranging from $18.25 to $18.75 per share.  </p>
<p>Westar Capital is a unit of Western Resources Inc. Western had been opposed to Republic Industries Inc's proposed acquisition of ADT Ltd.</p>
<p>Westar's purchase of ADT shares comes about a week after Republic and ADT terminated their proposed merger.</p>
</text>
